.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>貴貴仔買，m̄-thang貴貴仔賣</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">32</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台譯se̍h-se̍h唸</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吳孟儒</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/ahlau-kau-beh.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>現場做仝步通譯，</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/ahlau-kau-beh.html\" target=\"_blank\">若聽無a̍h是聽làu-kau，是beh按怎？</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">34</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張淑真</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/jun.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>阿jūn（二）</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>38</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳&nbsp; &nbsp; 雷</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/e_72.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>人世間 ê 門牌</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/11/e_72.html\" target=\"_blank\">Jîn-sè-kan ê mn̂g-pâi</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">42</span></span></div></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div></div></div><div><br /></div></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: cen